        "TileImage": "$($repository 32c17cd4-9048-4d80-ad9d-9b0767b3ab6e).Image",
        "Description": "47,\rthe targets are behaving in an unusual manner. It seems like they got struck with some kind of fever. A ... Disco Fever. Act quick 47, before this can spread through all of Marrakesh.\rEliminate the targets in one explosion or they might reproduce.\rAnd lets not forget Happy Birthday Zeus!\r\rBy Celllie",
